        <p>Noticed of births, marriages, and deaths, in memoriam notices, and acknowledgments of sympathy are inserted in the " Examiner " at the following .rates I—Not _ exceeding 20</p>
        <p>words, is. 6d. e3h; every-s-ciditlOnal aiiven words, 6d.</p>
        <p>• Marriages. DITNN—BROCKLEHDRST.—On the 23rd inst., at Bold-street Wesleyan Church, by the Rev. Joseph Howard, Arthur Mills Dunn. son of the late Mr. Alfred H. and Mrs: Dunn, of Stockton Heath, to M Ethel, only daughter of r. and Mrs. Brockle- burst, of Moss House, Stockton Heath.</p>
