        <p>MOORE,</p>
        <p>Church Institute.—Au American tea on Thursday afternoon in the above in aid of the funds of the DaresburY Nursing Association, and was organised ladies of the Nursing Committee. syll,( also in attendance at the stalls, whic; laden with a large assortment of gouE useful and ornamental, There was also collection of flowers, which found a verY sale. The tea was in the capable hands 4 J. G. Jones, and was much enjoyed. 'The a large attendance, and the affair was ix way a huge success. It is hoped the fund will benefit considerably from the taking.</p>
