      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-25_WidnesExaminer_art0224" n="art0224">
        <head>Gnawing Pain in the Back.</head>
        <p>Gnawing Pain in the Back.</p>
        <p>"I had a miserable gnawing pain right across my back, and in my loins for a long time," says Mrs. S. A. Rowlinson, of 126, Knutsford -road, Latchford, Warrington." I have no doubt it was due to my kidneys being out of order.</p>
        <p>"'his continual pain made my life wretched. I could not stoop, and when I walked about the pain was very trying. It used to keep me awake at night, and I felt languid and tired all day. "As I could tell that my kidneys were out of order I made up my mind to try Doan's Backache Kidney Pills. I felt much better before I had finished the first box, and after giving the pills a fair trial I was quite cured. lam very grateful for the grand and lasting relief Doan's Pills have given me. (Signed)" S. A. ROWLINSON."</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-25_WidnesExaminer_art0225" n="art0225">
