        <p>7 ). ,I fJt omue an tr e thati n t e rweißiti e dp, ii yn asnevln: . per cent. per annum, combined with undoubted security, address for further particulars, E.G. Roaors. Esa_ ~ Trafal- -0 Gar House. 11. waterloo Place, London, S,W.</p>
